<div id="u-credit-00315-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lx-forever" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6599059); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6599059&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609144422" alt="LX-forever" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6599059)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lx-forever" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6599059); return false;">LX-forever</a></span></p>
